00:18:00.759 --> 00:18:03.039
And that's that, and again, it felt very filmic.
就是这样，再一次，感觉非常电影化。

00:18:03.039 --> 00:18:08.519
It felt like Richard Linkletter before sunrise, like we all, Josh and I talk about all the time, how much we love those movies.
感觉就像日出前的理查德·林克莱特（Richard Linkletter），就像我们所有人，乔什和我一直在谈论我们有多么喜欢这些电影。

00:18:08.519 --> 00:18:13.559
Like, did you, did you realize you were sort of safe to keep doing that?
就像，你有没有意识到继续这样做是安全的？

00:18:13.559 --> 00:18:15.440
And then it worked once you saw Drumroll please?
当你看到 Drumroll 时，它就起作用了？

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:22.680
Like, did it take that moment Pam showing you that to feel like, oh yeah, this works on the show, I'm not gonna, you never seem like you were worried about getting fired by the way.
就像，帕姆在那一刻向你展示了这一点，让你感觉，哦，是的，这在节目中有效，我不会，你似乎从来没有担心过会被解雇。

00:18:22.680 --> 00:18:24.279
you seemed very assured and calm.
你看起来非常自信和平静。

00:18:24.279 --> 00:18:25.960
I never would have thought that, Ashley.
我从来没有想到过这一点，阿什利。

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:26.799
I never would have thought that.
我从来没想过会这样。

00:18:26.799 --> 00:18:29.400
That might be the, that might be where the acting comes from.
这可能就是表演的来源。

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.240
You're not gonna hold up.
你不会坚持下去的。

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:36.240
I specifically remember in the audition, I made a joke and I made you guys laugh.
我特别记得在试镜的时候，我开了一个玩笑，让你们笑了。

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:37.160
Was I in your audition?
我参加过你的试镜吗？

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.359
Did I read with you?
我和你一起读书了吗？

00:18:38.359 --> 00:18:39.200
Uh-uh.
呃呃。

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:40.039
Yeah, I didn't think I did.
是的，我不认为我做到了。

00:18:40.039 --> 00:18:45.880
It was me and Pam and Carter, I think, I think, because we knew it was such an important role and we all wanted to be there, yeah.
我想是我、帕姆和卡特，因为我们知道这是一个如此重要的角色，我们都想在那里，是的。

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:46.720
It was a three of you.
那是你们三个人。

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:52.400
And by the way, I remember getting to the audition waiting room and there weren't that many people there.
顺便说一句，我记得去试镜候诊室时，那里人不多。

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:59.519
And I was like, and it was my first, it was the first budget, it wasn't a call back, it wasn't like a, didn't you, I don't even think it was a producer session.
我当时想，这是我的第一个，这是第一个预算，这不是回电，不像，不是吗，我什至不认为这是制片人会议。

00:18:59.519 --> 00:19:01.220
It was just an audition.
这只是一次试镜。

