00:19:06.839 --> 00:19:13.440
There's sometimes you show up and there's literally a hundred people in front of you and you have to like send a text like, can someone let my dog out, you know?
有时你出现时，实际上有一百个人在你面前，你必须发一条短信，比如，有人可以把我的狗放出来吗，你知道吗？

00:19:13.440 --> 00:19:14.440
I'm gonna be here all day.
我会在这里待一整天。

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:17.240
Yeah, this was a different, this felt special.
是的，这是一个不同的，这感觉很特别。

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:22.359
And I remember I was wearing, I had just gotten this like very cool shirt.
我记得我穿着我刚买的一件非常酷的衬衫。

00:19:22.359 --> 00:19:25.119
It was like this like neat top and it was like sparkly.
就像这样，像整洁的上衣，又像闪闪发光。

00:19:25.119 --> 00:19:26.920
It was whatever it was 2005.
无论如何，那是2005年的事情。

00:19:26.920 --> 00:19:30.960
So I don't know how cool it actually was, but I was proud of it.
所以我不知道它到底有多酷，但我为此感到自豪。

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:37.200
And I came in and either you or Carter said, I like your shirt.
我进来时，你或卡特都说，我喜欢你的衬衫。

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:38.400
And I said.
我说。

